{
 "_comment": "Mamma Mia board, 18.5 s (the sound twice), in the symmetric centred style on Aegean blue (my pick: whitewash and blue like the island, and it makes the pinks and sequins pop), thin white borders, even 20 px gaps, hard cuts. Single centred photos between collages that build from the centre in mirrored pairs (a six-up grid, a four-up grid, wide photos stacked), plus two photo-inside-a-photo moments (the pink disco ball inside the bougainvillea tower, the sailboat inside the flower balconies). Film stills are described by scene, nobody is named. Opens on the bride and friends on the rocks; the fireworks over the lake land on the second pass's big hit and hold.",
